{"3847070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Woofy Run", "steam_appid": 3847070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.poster.avif?t=1771420444\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.webm?t=1771420444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.mp4?t=1771420444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woofy Run</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer dog parkour game. Players race through chaotic obstacle courses, attack their rivals to push them off the track, and fiercely compete to reach the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite dog breed, customize it with funny outfits, and race against your friends in lively, dangerous arenas. Use your reflexes and strategy to dodge obstacles, attack at the right moment, and eliminate your opponents. You can bite your rivals to push them off the course, causing them to fall into water or off cliffs  and you’ll look hilarious while doing it. Bark and howl to challenge your rivals, celebrate your victory, or increase the chaos even further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Parkour Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through chaotic parkour courses with up to 5 players in real time. Create a private lobby, invite your friends, and race together in chaotic, fast-paced multiplayer races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offensive Combat Mechanics</strong><br>Bite your opponents during races and use physical force to knock them off the track. A well-timed attack can cause rivals to fall into water, tumble off cliffs, or be completely eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barking and Howling Interactions</strong><br>Bark or howl during races to provoke your rivals, create fun moments with friends, or loudly celebrate your victory at the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Obstacle Courses</strong><br>Run through themed maps such as city parks, amusement parks, forests, and space stations. Each course is filled with moving platforms, jump pads, and hazards that amplify player-driven chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Dog Customization</strong><br>Earn points during gameplay and spend them on costumes, hats, glasses, and accessories. Show off your style with cosmetic items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Breeds</strong><br>Choose from <strong>12 different dog breeds</strong>, including Labrador, Shiba Inu, Dalmatian, and Bulldog. Each breed features unique animations and optional abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Track the fastest players worldwide on each map. Save your personal best times, compare scores with friends, and race for the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Rewards</strong><br>Complete challenges, unlock achievements, and earn points for new customizations. Seasonal events introduce limited-time challenges and exclusive cosmetics.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.poster.avif?t=1771420444\" width=720 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.webm?t=1771420444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/extras/936fe34e87dd2a588c6c0ec6e03f5ec8.mp4?t=1771420444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woofy Run</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer dog parkour game. Players race through chaotic obstacle courses, attack their rivals to push them off the track, and fiercely compete to reach the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite dog breed, customize it with funny outfits, and race against your friends in lively, dangerous arenas. Use your reflexes and strategy to dodge obstacles, attack at the right moment, and eliminate your opponents. You can bite your rivals to push them off the course, causing them to fall into water or off cliffs  and you’ll look hilarious while doing it. Bark and howl to challenge your rivals, celebrate your victory, or increase the chaos even further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Parkour Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through chaotic parkour courses with up to 5 players in real time. Create a private lobby, invite your friends, and race together in chaotic, fast-paced multiplayer races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offensive Combat Mechanics</strong><br>Bite your opponents during races and use physical force to knock them off the track. A well-timed attack can cause rivals to fall into water, tumble off cliffs, or be completely eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barking and Howling Interactions</strong><br>Bark or howl during races to provoke your rivals, create fun moments with friends, or loudly celebrate your victory at the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Obstacle Courses</strong><br>Run through themed maps such as city parks, amusement parks, forests, and space stations. Each course is filled with moving platforms, jump pads, and hazards that amplify player-driven chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Dog Customization</strong><br>Earn points during gameplay and spend them on costumes, hats, glasses, and accessories. Show off your style with cosmetic items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Breeds</strong><br>Choose from <strong>12 different dog breeds</strong>, including Labrador, Shiba Inu, Dalmatian, and Bulldog. Each breed features unique animations and optional abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Track the fastest players worldwide on each map. Save your personal best times, compare scores with friends, and race for the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Rewards</strong><br>Complete challenges, unlock achievements, and earn points for new customizations. Seasonal events introduce limited-time challenges and exclusive cosmetics.</p>", "short_description": "Woofy Run is a multiplayer dog racing game where speed, strategy, and sabotage come together. Set traps, avoid obstacles, and race to be one of the top 10 fastest players on every map! Select your favourite dog and join the race!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/17ff5dac79bce10894759d56447cf5be5b319412/header.jpg?t=1771420444", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847070/ef215719a64b3e3f3ef609c8b06045cfc8d46022/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771420444", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.aka